  "title": "Google Earth's AI Image Generator Shuts Down Amid Misinformation",
  "summary": "Security experts warn that Google Earth's AI tool, designed to generate fake satellite images, risks eroding trust in real-world data. However, the tool was temporarily halted after a single day of public backlash.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The AI tool, originally launched by Google, was pulled from the market after users reported the feature could be used to create misleading images.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google announced that the tool would be shut down within one day to prevent misuse of AI-generated content.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The tool's release was criticized for enabling misinformation, as seen in the example of refugees near the Mexican border.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
