    {
      "title": "Google Earth AI tool pulled after spate of fake satellite images",
      "link": "https://www.ft.com/content/06b7545b-94a0-4a5d-9c21-0c7852771b41?syn-25a6b1a6=1",
      "description": "Security experts say generative tools risk eroding trust in satellite images used to verify conflict damage and incidents",
